-- passing ``verts`` to ``Axes.scatter`` (use ``marker`` instead)
-- passing ``obj_type`` to ``cbook.deprecated``
-
-The following call signatures are deprecated:
-
-- passing a ``wx.EvtHandler`` as first argument to ``backend_wx.TimerWx``
