-`MATLAB <https://www.mathworks.com/help/matlab/ref/view.html>`_
-(though MATLAB lacks a roll angle). Note that a positive roll angle rotates the
-viewing plane clockwise, so the 3d axes will appear to rotate
-counter-clockwise.
